<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Tucson Electric started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Tucson Electric started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst William Tilles said he initiated coverage of Tuscon Electric Power Co with an underperform rating.</p>
<p>-- He declined to provide further details immediately. He also said said he started El Paso Electric Co with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Tucson Electric was trading off an 1/8 at 16-5/8 Thursday morning on slight volume.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
